Steam invokes this the way it invokes Proton:

    keel waitforexitandrun <windows-exe> [args...]

Logs go to stderr and to $STEAM_COMPAT_DATA_PATH/keel.log.
Path verbs print a single path on stdout and nothing else.
"""

